WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:18.334
Too-Too listened very long and hard.

2
00:00:18.335 --> 00:00:22.186
"What do you hear now, Too-Too?" Dab-Dab asked.

3
00:00:22.187 --> 00:00:28.187
"I don't think it's a man or a woman . . . ," he said, confused.

4
00:00:28.188 --> 00:00:31.039
Soon Dr. Dolittle returned with an ax.

5
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:34.643
"Move back, everyone," he called out.

6
00:00:34.644 --> 00:00:39.097
Dr. Dolittle raised the ax and chopped a hole in the door.

7
00:00:39.098 --> 00:00:41.289
He did it again and again.

8
00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:48.463
"There! Now, let's see who is behind this door," the doctor said.

9
00:00:48.464 --> 00:00:50.822
It was very dark inside.

10
00:00:50.823 --> 00:00:53.271
Dr. Dolittle found a lamp.

11
00:00:53.272 --> 00:00:55.402
The room was very small.

12
00:00:55.403 --> 00:00:57.851
There were lots of barrels.

13
00:00:57.852 --> 00:01:04.806
"This must be where the pirates keep their rum," said Jip.

14
00:01:04.807 --> 00:01:08.886
In between two barrels sat a little boy crying.

15
00:01:08.887 --> 00:01:11.796
He seemed scared of Dr. Dolittle.

16
00:01:11.797 --> 00:01:14.732
So the doctor spoke gently to him.

17
00:01:14.733 --> 00:01:20.244
"Hello, there." The boy looked up at the man with the kind voice.

18
00:01:20.245 --> 00:01:25.702
"Are you a pirate?" the boy asked.

19
00:01:25.703 --> 00:01:29.886
"No. I'm a doctor," Dr. Dolittle laughed.

20
00:01:29.887 --> 00:01:32.372
The little boy stopped crying.

21
00:01:32.373 --> 00:01:35.545
"Where is my uncle?" he asked.

22
00:01:35.546 --> 00:01:41.997
"Your uncle? Well, I don't know," Dr. Dolittle replied.

23
00:01:41.998 --> 00:01:49.922
The boy started crying again.

24
00:01:49.923 --> 00:01:52.909
Dr. Dolittle took the boy upstairs.

25
00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:56.209
"Do you like biscuits?" the doctor asked.

26
00:01:56.210 --> 00:02:00.282
"Oh, I do. Can I have one, please?" Gub-Gub asked.

27
00:02:00.283 --> 00:02:06.858
After eating a biscuit and drinking some hot tea, the boy told Dr. Dolittle what happened.

28
00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:09.812
"My uncle and I were fishing.

29
00:02:09.813 --> 00:02:13.362
But the Barbary pirates came and took our boat.

30
00:02:13.363 --> 00:02:16.210
They wanted my uncle to be a pirate!

31
00:02:16.211 --> 00:02:19.334
But my uncle didn't want to be like them."

32
00:02:19.335 --> 00:02:23.505
The boy paused, and the doctor poured him more tea.

33
00:02:23.506 --> 00:02:28.109
"So the pirates got angry," the boy continued.

34
00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:31.654
"They were going to throw my uncle into the ocean.

35
00:02:31.655 --> 00:02:34.189
They put me in the rum room.

36
00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:39.380
And after that, I didn't see my uncle." He began to cry.

37
00:02:39.381 --> 00:02:41.749
Dr. Dolittle tried to comfort him.

38
00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:45.967
"Don't cry. Maybe your uncle is fine."

39
00:02:45.968 --> 00:02:47.502
"Ask the dolphins.

40
00:02:47.503 --> 00:02:52.690
Maybe they saw the uncle," Dab-Dab whispered in Dr. Dolittle's ear.

41
00:02:52.691 --> 00:02:55.979
"That's a good idea," the doctor replied.

42
00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:59.913
"What are those sounds you are making?" the boy asked.

43
00:02:59.914 --> 00:03:05.651
"I'm using duck language," said the doctor, smiling.

44
00:03:05.652 --> 00:03:09.196
The little boy wanted to speak duck language, too.

45
00:03:09.197 --> 00:03:14.643
"What's that strange animal?" he pointed to the pushmi-pullyu.

46
00:03:14.644 --> 00:03:16.256
"That's a pushmi-pullyu.

47
00:03:16.257 --> 00:03:19.446
He's very shy," the doctor whispered.

48
00:03:19.447 --> 00:03:24.281
"He's got two heads!" the boy exclaimed.

49
00:03:24.282 --> 00:03:27.379
"SSSH!" the doctor calmed the boy down.

50
00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.026
"Don't talk about his heads.

51
00:03:29.027 --> 00:03:30.779
He's very sensitive."

52
00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:33.753
Dr. Dolittle asked many more questions.

53
00:03:33.754 --> 00:03:36.851
"What does your uncle look like?"

54
00:03:36.852 --> 00:03:38.622
"He has red hair.

55
00:03:38.623 --> 00:03:41.731
My uncle is very strong but kind.

56
00:03:41.732 --> 00:03:46.344
He is the best sailor in the world!" the boy boasted.

57
00:03:46.345 --> 00:03:50.271
"What is his boat called?" Dr. Dolittle asked.

58
00:03:50.272 --> 00:03:53.918
"The Saucy Sally," replied the boy.

59
00:03:53.919 --> 00:03:57.759
"Stay here. I am going to talk to the dolphins."

60
00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:01.892
With that, the doctor got up.

61
00:04:01.893 --> 00:04:04.650
Dr. Dolittle called the dolphins.

62
00:04:04.651 --> 00:04:08.765
"Hello, Dr. Dolittle! How was Africa?" one shouted.

63
00:04:08.766 --> 00:04:13.784
"Oh, lovely! Can you do something for me?" the doctor asked.

64
00:04:13.785 --> 00:04:20.780
Of course the dolphins would do anything for Dr. Dolittle.
